The schubert_cdi example dataset in data/schubert_cdi.rda is derived from
MicrobiomeHD version 3 (Duvallet, Gibbons, Gurry, Irizarry and Alm;
https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.1146764), using the Schubert et al. cohort
(https://doi.org/10.1128/mBio.01021-14). It retains the source dataset's
Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International license:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/.

The prepared dataset applies cohort and taxon filtering, taxonomic
aggregation, covariate coding and age standardization. Preparation scripts
are available in the SACAT repository under
Analysis/RealDataAnalysis/cdi_schubert/ and data-raw/.
